<title>USA: GC Cos gets $250 mln commitment to expand.</title>
<headline>GC Cos gets $250 mln commitment to expand.</headline>
<dateline>CHESTNUT HILL, Mass. 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>GC Cos Inc said on Wednesday it reached an agreement in principle with a major financial institution to receive $250 million over the next five years to finance its movie theatre expansion program.</p>
<p>GC said it was commited to opening 19 new megaplex theatres with about 270 screens over the next three years, including 80 screens in fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
